# 13.7 Technology Stack

The AI & GraphRAG Engine shall utilize the following technologies.

| Component | Recommended Technology |
|-----------|------------------------|
| LLM | Gemini 2.5 Pro / GPT-5-class model (configurable) |
| Embeddings | BAAI BGE-M3 |
| Vector Database | Qdrant |
| Graph Database | Neo4j |
| Framework | LangGraph |
| NLP | spaCy |
| OCR | Tesseract / Azure Document Intelligence (optional) |
| Background Jobs | Celery |
| Message Broker | Redis |
| Backend | FastAPI |

All AI components shall remain configurable to support future model upgrades.

